@startuml
!include skin.iuml
title Bagian 2: Class dan Object
left to right direction

class Brand {
  +name : String
  +country : String
  --
  +Brand(name : String, country : String)
  +getName() : String
  +getCountry() : String
  +getInfo() : String
}

class Car {
  +plate : String
  +model : String
  +year : int
  +available : boolean
  --
  +Car(plate : String, model : String, year : int)
  +getPlate() : String
  +getModel() : String
  +getYear() : int
  +isAvailable() : boolean
  +rentOut() : boolean
  +returnVehicle() : void
}
note bottom of Car
  Mobil baru: available = true.
  rentOut() true sekali, lalu false
  selama masih disewa.
end note
@enduml
